Feature: Bank Account Details

  Scenario: TC007_Bank Account Details
    Given The Profile Details is visible
  Then Click Bank Account Tab
  Then Click Account Holder Name
  When Enter Account Holder Name "Account Holder Name"
  Then Click Bank Name
  When Enter Bank Name "Bank Name"
  Then Click Branch Name
  When Enter Branch Name "Branch Name"
  Then Click IFSC Code
  When Enter IFSC Code "IFSC"
  Then Click Account Number
  When Enter Account Number
  Then Click Retype Account Number
  When Enter Retype Account Number

